        <p class="cycle-card-desc">購入素材を使わず保存。</p>
    </div>
    <span class="cycle-flow-arrow">↓</span>
    <div class="cycle-card cycle-card-accent-red">
        <div class="cycle-card-title">🔥 KvK準備 Day1〜5</div>
        <p class="cycle-card-desc">対象日に合わせて素材を放出。</p>
    </div>
    <span class="cycle-flow-arrow">↓</span>
    <div class="cycle-card cycle-card-accent-red">
        <div class="cycle-card-title">⚔️ KvK王城戦</div>
        <p class="cycle-card-desc">サイクルの節目。</p>
    </div>
    <span class="cycle-flow-arrow">🔄</span>
    <span class="cycle-flow-note">約28日周期</span>
